OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud
OL,6,Fincreasing overnight, with showery
OL,7,Frain arriving from the west, this
OL,8,Fpotentially heavy at times. A rather
OL,9,Fmild night under the blanket of cloud.
OL,10,FLight winds throughout.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FCloudy Monday with outbreaks
OL,13,Fof light patchy rain through the
OL,14,Fmorning and afternoon, becoming more
OL,15,Fpersistent later and then heavy as it
OL,16,Fpushes south overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
